<title>NETHERLANDS: CSM says current year 'satisfactory'.</title>
<headline>CSM says current year 'satisfactory'.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foods group CSM said on Wednesday business over the current fiscal year had been 'satisfactory'.</p>
<p>&quot;The progress of business in the current year is satisfactory,&quot; it said in a statement. It gave no firm forecast for the 1996/97 year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
